      "assistant_text": "These two architectural decisions share a powerful, parallel pattern \u2014 they are both **Single Composition Points**: credential-scoping centralizes credential injection at one point (the spawning of each agent process), while runtime-paths centralizes path resolution at one point (Hub startup). Both decisions prioritize keeping complexity \u2014 credentials, paths, configuration sources \u2014 in one place so no other part of the codebase has to reinvent them.\n\nThis connection is genuinely new to the wiki and worth preserving. Let me create a synthesis page:",
